+          <p>The migration runner reads the repository-root <code>.env</code>. The backend reads <code>apps/orchestrator_3_stream/.env</code>. Those are different lookup paths; both files matter. The current migration runner does not require a copy under <code>apps/orchestrator_db/</code>.</p>
+          <p>Build the actual frontend before launching it:</p>
