+  .claude/commands/orch_plan_w_scouts_build_review.md</code></pre>
+          <p>Collect three artifacts: plan, built document, and review report. The event stream must show a sleep followed by <code>check_agent_status</code>. Completion evidence must include a response event followed by a Stop hook. If the workflow uses a slightly different sleep duration during the run, explain why the prompt-driven pattern matters more than the literal number.</p>
+          <div class="lab-box__pass"><strong>Checkpoint 4 · 20/20</strong><p>All three roles are identified correctly; the three documentation artifacts exist; every referenced path is course-local; the reviewer issues a verdict; and you can point to the prompt lines that create the sleep-check loop.</p></div>
